                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.51/2255: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Herod</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-01-16T14:00:00-04:40"><hi rendition="#italic">January 16,
                                1922—2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 4:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>4. Your 1, January 7, 2 p.m. Your instruction number 429 received to-day and I
                    have sent Acting Military Governor enclosure in the manner directed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herod</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
